// PENDING (awaiting `value(n, v)`: W's semantic value of a string, escapes decoded, a concatenated_string's pieces
// joined). Not read by the converter. When value is bound, replace the main file's authority_plain_value rule
// (the `str` approximation) with this one and add `value` to its `.input` line:
.decl value(n: node, v: symbol)
.input value
authority_plain_value(s, v) :- authority_setattr(_, a), child(a, s, _), authority_plain_prefix(s), value(s, v).
